# Conformance probe pack for `hex` in a sequential layout with bit_order
# msb-lsb, at an offset that is not a multiple of 4 (spec 0.22). Public. No
# kinds.
#
#   3 bits        x      unsigned
#   8 bits        label  two hex digits from bit 3; 5 bits of padding follow
format     conformance-long-hex-seq-mlsb
version    0.22.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb-lsb
field   probe.x      3  uint
field   probe.label  8  hex
